ogsr-moc provides CMake targets:

    find_package(ogsr-moc CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ogsr::moc)

MSBuild (vcpkg manifest mode): #include <MaskedOcclusionCulling.h>; MaskedOcclusionCulling.lib is auto-linked.
MaskedOcclusionCulling::Create() picks AVX2 or SSE4.1 at run time; GetImplementation() says which.
